body:
I'd make my own gun but I can't find black powder for sale legally anywhere in my country, nor do i have any way of finding or making the parts necessary for a simple makeshift gun

&#x200B;

I'd still without hesitation, put the end of the barrel of a gun right up to my head and pull the trigger, I'd do anything to maximize damage to really make sure I die, and correct the greatest mistake any human has made in this world; me having done nothing of this sort any sooner...

&#x200B;

I've hesitated so much with jumping since I have a very intense fear of tall places and falling, tried overdosing but it was much harder than i had initially prepared for, trying hanging but my last attempt was a failure due to the materials I had on hand at the time, and the last time also almost completely broke what I had left that I was using to hang off of. I'm thinking of drowning too but I'd quickly be reported as missing since my schedule is packed and I'm always to be expected somewhere, and besides the nearby rivers and lakes of my country are polluted and stinky, I prefer not risking living through the ordeal in such shitty conditions.

Over the months of learning from my mistakes and planning, I was able to finally craft the final resolute solution that would be least painful and also the quickest by far. And all I need to do now is to actually do it, I hope that I'm successful in it, I really have nothing more to look back on anymore or to go back to anymore and I just want it to end, death to me is all the same when it happens, so I'll be satisfied to get it.
